CHAPTER IX
CERTIFICATION TRADE MARKS
Certain provisions of this Act not applicable to certification trade marks.
69. The following provisions of this Act shall not apply to certification trade marks, that is to say,—
(a) clauses (a) and (c) of sub-section (1) of section 9;
(b) sections 18, 20 and 21, except as expressly applied by this Chapter;
(c) sectiona 28, 29, 30, 41, 42, 47, 48, 49, 50, 52, 54 and sub-section (2) of section 56;
(d) Chapter XII, except section 107.
