(x)
the manner of submitting statement of cases under sub-section (2) of section 40;
(xi)
the manner of making an application by the proprietor of a trade mark under section 41;
(xii)
the manner of making an application for assignment or transmission of a certification trade mark under section 43;
(xiii)
the manner of making an application to the Registrar to register title under sub-section (1) of section 45;
[(xiiia)
the period within which the Registrar shall dispose of an application under sub-section (3) of section 45;]
(xiv)
